{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/962279-how-soon-could-we-see-ctl-2e","id":962279,"title":"How soon could we see CtL 2e?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-02T07:48:50-07:00","id":962279,"title":"How soon could we see CtL 2e?","content":"I'm fairly new to CofD, and I noticed that Changeling is in development. When is the pre-errata pdf likely to come out? I was thinking about 2 months from now, but I'm not sure how fast Onyx Path works, anyone have a general idea?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12094,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12094-k9ine","user":"K9ine","date":". 09-02-2016, 11:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12094-k9ine","name":"K9ine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12094_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"270"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T09:25:14-07:00","id":962327,"title":"","content":"Your official answer is always going to be &quot;this wednesday!&quot; or &quot;eventually.&quot; Given we haven't heard anything from the monday meeting notes, the answer is probably still &quot;eventually!&quot; Personal estimation from years of being frustrated at waiting for things to be done and years of experience with bullshitting timeframes: early 2017. With the amount of information we are given as a community it is pretty much impossible to guess anything but &quot;a few months from now&quot; or &quot;a few years from now&quot; for the release date of a given book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6365-fumus","name":"Fumus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6365_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T09:43:23-07:00","id":962339,"title":"","content":"I'd really love to hear any sort of update on how things are going... I'm hoping since Promethean is out things will move forward faster now? Maybe? CtL is my favorite chronicles line by far and I have been excited for 2e since it was announced. I don't want to just come off as an entitled fan; I know it takes a lot of work and they are juggling a lot of different projects at the same time. But any update or sign of progress would be nice...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3533-sonofgaia","name":"SonOfGaia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T09:47:10-07:00","id":962343,"title":"","content":"Onyx Path projects are like snowflakes.<br /> <br /> There's really no way to accurately predict how long a given project will take, or even how long a single stage of a given project will take, until it's almost finished. Pretty much, until something reaches the &quot;In Layout&quot; stage in the Monday meeting notes, don't count on it coming out within the year. It might, but don't count on it. Once it's &quot;In Layout&quot;, it's probably a safe bet that it'll be done in a few months, but you never know, sometimes it's several. Once it hits &quot;Proofing&quot;, then you can start getting hyped about an impending release. You won't get a release date until the Monday before the advance PDF comes out (at which point they'll say &quot;It'll be out on Wednesday&quot;), but that's the point where I let myself get more excited with each passing week. Sometimes that hype train keeps going for a couple months, but I know I've got enough steam for that, and your mileage may vary.<br /> <br /> As for Lost 2e specifically? With it still in the &quot;Development&quot; stage (not even post-editing development!) I think Fumus' &quot;early 2017 estimate is very optimistic. If I were to take a shot in the dark, I'd say summer 2017, and I wouldn't even be confident in that estimate. In the mean time, there's been more than enough material previewed to playtest it, or to cobble together a 1.5e.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T09:54:00-07:00","id":962346,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SonOfGaia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/962279-how-soon-could-we-see-ctl-2e?p=962339#post962339\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd really love to hear any sort of update on how things are going... I'm hoping since Promethean is out things will move forward faster now? Maybe? CtL is my favorite chronicles line by far and I have been excited for 2e since it was announced. I don't want to just come off as an entitled fan; I know it takes a lot of work and they are juggling a lot of different projects at the same time. But any update or sign of progress would be nice...</div> </div> </div> </div>The gradual movement from one stage to the next in the Monday meeting notes are our signs of progress. There's not really much else they can tell us at this point. It's in the &quot;Development&quot; stage now, which means it's still got a ways to go (editing, post-editing development, art direction, and then the layout/proofing loop, which can take a couple cycles). But, we're past First and Second Drafts, which means progress is being made.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T10:14:19-07:00","id":962352,"title":"","content":"Keeping an eye on the Monday Meeting notes are your best bet. I've seen it said a few times elsewhere that those notes are the most detailed and exact information that OPP itself has, so you're pretty much not going to get better information than that.<br /> <br /> ...but yeah. What Fumus said. We can start a betting pool if you want, but that's really all anyone knows (including the developer).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T11:45:08-07:00","id":962404,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fumus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/962279-how-soon-could-we-see-ctl-2e?p=962327#post962327\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Your official answer is always going to be &amp;quot;this wednesday!&amp;quot; or &amp;quot;eventually.